1
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Do you believe that your dreams are your own?

2
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Strawberry Mansion is a fantasy, science fiction,
adventure film directed by Kentucker Audley.

3
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,000
In the not-too-distant future, an all-seeing surveillance state conducts “dream
audits” to collect taxes on the unconscious lives of the populace.

4
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Mild-mannered government agent James Preble travels to a remote farmhouse to audit
the dreams of Arabella “Bella” Isadora, an eccentric, aging artist.

5
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Entering Bella’s vast VHS archive, which contains a lifetime of dreams, Preble
stumbles upon a secret that offers him a chance at love—and hope for escape.

6
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Arabella “Bella” Isadora, played by Penny Fuller.

7
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:34,000
James Preble, played by Kentucker Audley.

8
