12
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
Strawberry Mansion is a 2021 American surrealist science fantasy adventure
film directed and written by Albert Birney and Kentucker Audley.

13
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:58,000
It stars Penny Fuller, Kentucker Audley, Grace Glowicki, Reed
Birney, Linas Phillips
and Constance Shulman.

14
